{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdzZEKDrYQRf2bhAbs6Z9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Plan\n\n1. **Call `payments.provider_status()`** immediately (cheap, read-only, safe).\n   - If it returns promptly with a healthy status: the provider is reachable; the first timeout was likely cold-start latency.\n   - If it hangs or errors: the provider itself is unavailable or unreachable; stop here and escalate (do not retry submit).\n\n2. **Call `payments.get(order_id=7841)`** (read-only, harmless, idempotent).\n   - If it returns a payment record for this order: the submit *did* land despite the timeout — do not resubmit. Record the incident as cold-start and proceed with the order using the confirmed payment.\n   - If it returns empty: the submit either never reached the provider or was lost in-flight; the commit state is unknown.\n\n3. **Only if both above succeed promptly AND `payments.get` returned empty:**\n   - Resubmit `payments.submit(order_id=7841, amount_usd=120.00)` once in this warm session.\n   - If it returns promptly this time: cold-start confirmed; proceed.\n   - If it times out again: this is a stable failure, not cold-start; escalate without further retry.\n\n---\n\n## Explicit statement on resubmit:\n\n**Do not call `payments.submit` again unless:**\n- The provider status check and `payments.get` both return promptly (ruling out a shared outage), **and**\n- `payments.get(7841)` returns empty (confirming the first submit did not land), **and**\n- This is the warm retry in the same session (not a blind replay after an unknown commit state).\n\nA second timeout after a warm, successful status check earns diagnosis as a stable per-target failure and stops retries."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1873,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"outp